flowchart TB
    A[Capture frame<br/>PiCamera2 RGB888] --> B[Center square crop]
    B --> C[YOLO26 NCNN inference<br/>imgsz=640, conf=0.4, IoU=0.5<br/>class=0 person only]
    C --> D[ByteTrack association<br/>track_id assigned]
    D --> E{Center inside<br/>queue polygon?}
    E -- no --> F[Ignore]
    E -- yes --> G[Queue State Tracker]
    G --> H{Track departed<br/>and dwell ≥ 3 s?}
    H -- yes --> I[Emit PersonEvent<br/>entry, exit, dwell]
    H -- no --> G
    I --> J[Wait Estimator<br/>rolling 15-min throughput]
    G --> K[Queue length = active tracks]
    J --> L[Wait = len / throughput]
    L --> M[Busyness level<br/>green / yellow / red]
    K --> M
    M --> N[Sense HAT render]
    L --> O[Comfort Score<br/>with T / RH / P]
    O --> P[QueueStatusResponse]
    P --> Q[Shared state +<br/>MJPEG overlay]
    P --> R[Snapshot<br/>every 30 s → SQLite]
    P --> S[Hub Sync push<br/>every 2.5 s]
